WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.368
-Now, look, we love
our audience.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.636
You watch us every night.

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.337
But right now, we want to change
things up and watch you.

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:06.672
We asked you guys at home

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:09.408
to send us some fun or unique
talents that you have.

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:10.810
Quest, get ready,
these are good.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.645
We got submissions
from thousands of people

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:15.448
all across the world, and we're
going to meet some of them now.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:18.251
It's time for
"Show Me Something Good."

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:22.689
-♪ Show me something good,
show me something good ♪

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:26.426
♪ Show me something good,
won't you just show me ♪

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.395
-Alright, let's meet
our first guest.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:29.428
Hello.

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:31.397
Hi!
-Hello!

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.633
-What is your name,
and where are you from?

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:36.936 line:0%
-My name is Leigh, and
I'm from Princeton, New Jersey.

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.638 line:0%
-Hey, New Jersey! Leigh!

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:41.840
Yeah, come on, Leigh.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.143
I see you have props.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:46.045
What talent
will you be showing us?

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:49.982
-I am going to be
balancing a book on my head,

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.951
playing the melodica --

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.521
This is my glorified
melodica stand --

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:57.557
I mean lovely roommate Ana.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.892
-Hey, Ana. How are you?
Nice to see you.

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:03.262
-I will also be spinning a piece
of color guard equipment.

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:06.232
-Oh, wow. This is unbelievable.
What a talent.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.034
How did you --
How did you figure out

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:10.136
that you could do this?

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.937
-Oh, it was just sheer luck.

00:01:11.937 --> 00:01:14.106
I knew I could do each
of these things individually

00:01:14.106 --> 00:01:16.976
and then figured, "Eh, let's see
if I can put them all together."

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.544
-Here we go. I think it's going
to be a show-stopper.

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:20.746
Whenever you're ready,
go for it.

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:22.448
-Alright. Here we go.

00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:25.785
-Alright, the book.
That's one talent there.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:29.022
Uh-huh. Wow.

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:30.923
-Whoa.

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:32.792
[ Melodica playing ]

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:35.361 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.796
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:39.665
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:42.068
Oh!

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.970
Oh, fantastic!

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.972 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:47.340
Leigh, thank you very much!

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.775
Oh, my God. Ana!

00:01:49.775 --> 00:01:52.478
Your assistant, Ana,
thank you very much.

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:54.981
Very talented.

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.449
That's fantastic.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.118
Thank you.
Let's meet our next guest here.

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:01.454
Hey, bud.
-Hello.

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.755
-How are you, pal?

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:05.324
What is your name,
and where you from?

00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:08.527 line:0%
-I'm Sam, and I'm from
Georgetown, Kentucky.

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:11.931 line:0%
-Hey, welcome to the show, Sam.

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:14.267
Sam, looks like
you need some artwork there.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.135
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:17.570
Anything. Uh...

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.806
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.774
You're not in a prison
somewhere, are you, Sam?

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.108
Are you okay?

00:02:23.108 --> 00:02:25.745
-No, I took it all off the wall,
'cause it's a bit busy.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:27.247
-Oh, I appreciate it, buddy.

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:30.316
What is the talent that you'll
be showing us tonight, bud?

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.684
-I can do a noise

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.153
that sounds like the wheel
from "The Wheel of Fortune."

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:37.090
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.391
-Sam?

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:41.194
Sam, you're sitting in front
of like three guitars.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.228
I'm just saying.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:43.696
You took the posters
off the wall.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.130
You have musical instruments.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:46.199
What is your talent again?

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:48.567
You're making the sound
of the what?

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:51.136
-[ Laughing ] The wheel
from "The Wheel of Fortune."

00:02:51.136 --> 00:02:54.139
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:54.139 --> 00:02:57.042
-Well, I think we can maybe
help you out with this.

00:02:57.042 --> 00:02:58.410
Audience, can you help him out?

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.447
On the count of three,
we'll say, "Wheel of Fortune,"

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.515
then Sam will do his thing.

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:05.318
You ready? 1, 2, 3.
[ Drum roll ]

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:08.755
-Wheel of Fortune!
-Wheel of Fortune!

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:11.991
[ Breath clicking rapidly ]

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:17.397
[ Clicking slowing ]

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:19.966
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:24.103 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:25.871
-Sam, that was amazing!

00:03:25.871 --> 00:03:27.106
That's what I'm talking about.

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:29.108
That's good TV right there.

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:30.909
How in the heck
did you know to do that?

00:03:30.909 --> 00:03:32.111
I love it.

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:34.213
Let's meet our final guest here.

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:37.283
Hello! Hi. What's your name,
and where you from?

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:41.287 line:0%
-Hi. I'm Kyra Gallego, and I'm
from Los Angeles, California.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:42.622 line:0%
-Welcome.

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:44.156
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:45.558
Welcome to our show.

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.527
What talent will you be
sharing with us tonight?

00:03:48.527 --> 00:03:50.430
-Well, I'm not a ventriloquist,

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.531
but I can talk
with my mouth closed.

00:03:52.531 --> 00:03:54.934
-Mm. Alright,
I'm intrigued, Kyra.

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:58.671
Let's -- Show me
whenever you're ready.

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:00.139
Yeah. Show me what you can do.

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:02.675
-Okay. [ Clears throat ]

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:06.045
[ Muffled ]
Jimmy! Help me! It's Justin!

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:09.281
Can you hear me?

00:04:09.281 --> 00:04:11.584 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:13.853
-I couldn't hear you. I think --

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:16.388
Did you say, "It's me.
It's Kyra. Can you hear me?"

00:04:16.388 --> 00:04:17.557
Is that what you said?

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:20.293
-Justin Timberlake.
He's calling for you.

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:22.962
-I was like,
"It's Dustin from my libido."

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:24.663
That's what I heard.

00:04:24.663 --> 00:04:27.366
-No.
-But it's still amazing.

00:04:27.366 --> 00:04:30.135
How do you do that?

00:04:30.135 --> 00:04:32.338
-Well, I'm a teacher,

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:34.873
so I got to get kids
to pay attention somehow.

00:04:34.873 --> 00:04:38.611
So I'll be like,
"Hey, pay attention!"

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.845
[ Both laugh ]

00:04:39.845 --> 00:04:41.547
And they just -- "Whoa."

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:44.116
-"Hey, pay --"
Yeah, like, what is going on?

00:04:44.116 --> 00:04:46.853
Well, I was thinking,
this could be kind of fun.

00:04:46.853 --> 00:04:49.221
Could we bring everyone else
back on the screen?

00:04:49.221 --> 00:04:51.390
Could you guys maybe play us out
with a song

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.992
if you guys
combine your talents?

00:04:53.992 --> 00:04:57.163
-Oh, sure. We got a beautiful
little ballad for you.

00:04:59.698 --> 00:05:03.202
[ Melodica playing ]
-[ Muffled vocalizing ]

00:05:03.202 --> 00:05:08.173 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:08.173 --> 00:05:10.043
[ Breath clicking ]

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:12.011
[ Melodica,
vocalization continue ]

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:17.750 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.519
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:05:20.519 --> 00:05:23.455
Come on back.

00:05:23.455 --> 00:05:25.891
I thought you forgot about Sam!

00:05:25.891 --> 00:05:28.895 line:0%
I thought they forgot about Sam.
Oh, my gosh.

